# Agent scratch space: cloned repositories and run artefacts
.nightshift/
workspaces/

# The fork pool proposal is an intermediate: regenerated on every search run and
# noisy in a diff. `fleet/pool.json` is NOT ignored — it is the reviewed list the
# fleet runs on, and it belongs in the history so a night's results can be tied
# to the exact set of repositories that produced them.
fleet/candidates.json

